WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Watch two targets appear in a quick stream. Sometimes the second one goes unnoticed.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers call that an attentional blink. An experiment looked at three months of intensive meditation training

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
and a laboratory task. It did not test a meditation app or an MP3 course.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 sells a structured set of recordings, but the scientific claim about a specific commercial audio

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
product needs its own evidence. Before choosing any recording, try a quiet twelve-minute task for yourself.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Learn what helps you begin. Then decide what convenience is worth.
